accTitle: Reviewing a plan on iPad
accDescr: Open the review, read its context, inspect relevant evidence, choose an approach and copy feedback. Resume later if interrupted.
Open[Open review on iPad] --> Read[Read context]
Read --> Inspect[Inspect evidence]
Inspect --> Choose[Choose and explain]
Choose --> Copy[Copy feedback]
Choose -->|interrupted| Pause[Keep local draft]
Pause -->|same browser| Choose
Copy --> Return[Paste into conversation]

